OL,3,GNEWSAResidents oppose college's housing
OL,4,Aplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a university college
OL,7,Fhave spoken of their concerns about a
OL,8,Fproposed development of student
OL,9,Faccommodation.
OL,11,FThe University of Cambridge's Hughes
OL,12,FHall submitted plans earlier this year
OL,13,Fto build on land next to the city's
OL,14,Ffamous Fenner's Cricket Ground
OL,16,FThe land was bought in 2024 with plans
OL,17,Fto build accommodation that the college
OL,18,Fsaid was needed to house more students
OL,19,Fon campus, but residents have claimed
OL,20,Fthe development is "excessive" and say
OL,21,Fthey fear for the future of cricket at
OL,22,Fthe site.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
