OL,3,GNEWSAResidents oppose college's housing
OL,4,Aplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Laurie Bristow, president of Hughes
OL,7,FHall, said the project followed "a
OL,8,Fgreat deal of careful design work and
OL,9,Fengagement with our neighbours,
OL,10,Fstudents and the wider Cambridge
OL,11,Fcommunity".
